<font face="helvetica,arial" size="4" color="FF0300"><b>Guild Donations - How To</b></font>
</td>
<td>
<p align="justify">
<font face="helvetica,arial" size="2"><b>
<u>Procedure:</u> If you would like to donate an item to the guild, contact an officer (ie. Alailya, Kluuvan, Nighon, Medicinal, Oakenfoot, Gilhedrine, Nandarin, Lanns, Elfesse, Xetus, Popajorgio, Coinneach, or Bobmd/Zabooboo/Zifnar) for drop-off/pick-up.
<br><br>
At the time of drop-off, please specify RAID FUND or GUILD ARMORY. 
<br><br>
RAID FUND items will be sold for a fair price and the money placed in the raid fund account. 
<br><br>
GUILD ARMORY items will be placed on the appropriate mule and made available to borrow by a guild member.
<br><br>
Any guild member borrowing an item or items from the Guild Armory must return the item(s) once done with it/them. You MAY NOT sell these items. All returns must be made to an officer or a designated mule.
<br><br>
Every Monday at 10:00 PM EST items will be transfered from the officers to the guild "Mule".
<br><br>
All Officers are asked to maintain at least one mule and he/she needs to be stationed in the Bazaar/PoK. Officers are responsible for transaction lists. A public record is available in the guild store for what may be borrowed or is currently out on loan.
<p align="center">
On behalf of the Officers, Elders and Cadets<br>
Bobmd Cureall<br>
Oracle of 62 Winters<br>
Guild Leader - SoD<br>
